  _glyph: "\U0001F412\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Bound to the Golden Cap
  _description: He and his band must obey whoever owns the [[b20111ba-0457-4d69-ae5e-8728d64388ce|Golden
    Cap]], three times each. They serve the [[4d91631d-e833-4bd5-a4c5-477a0fe8b0dc|Wicked
    Witch of the West]] until [[bff2dcff-df4c-46a2-a793-2f30f4a6a243|Dorothy Gale]]
    wins the Cap.
  _sortOrder: 12
